  "description": "When outside or in a natural setting: - Pause and observe: Look for plants around you—trees, flowers, even weeds. - Ask questions: What purpose do they serve? How do they fit into the ecosystem? - Learn their names: Identify one plant near you to deepen your appreciation. Example: Spot a tree near your office? Learn its type and think about its role in cooling the area or providing oxygen.",
